# ---------- Dataset contents ----------
data/raw/**
data/downloaded/**

# ---------- Derived UNSW pipeline outputs ----------
# Regenerable from data/raw/unsw_iot pcaps via scripts/UNSW-IoTraffic/.
# ~2.8 GB total; several individual files exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
# The small, hand-checkable end products (profiles/, objective1_report.json,
# data/mud_profiles/) stay tracked.
data/processed/unsw/zeek/**/*.log
data/processed/unsw/features/**/*.jsonl
data/processed/unsw/scores/**/*.jsonl

# ---------- Zeek run output (testbed) ----------
# Small today (~350 KB) so it stays tracked; if a future run's conn.log gets
# large, ignore it here rather than committing it.
#data/processed/testbed/runs/**/zeek/*.log
